 "item.yishu.dragon_core_shard.note": "Condensed dragon vein essence; used to claim a vein.",
 "item.yishu.flame_fragment.note": "Crystallised nether fire-sha; only yields once suppressed.",
 "item.yishu.soul_core.note": "A core sleeping in soul sand; yang energy reveals it.",
 "item.yishu.void_shard.note": "A shard of End void, touchable only by solid matter.",
 "item.yishu.chorus_core.note": "Seed of the chorus; only void force can wake it.",
 "item.yishu.dragon_breath_core.note": "What remains when the Ender Dragon falls.",
 "item.yishu.fate_book.note": "Bamboo paper recording a fate chart; readable on a lectern.",
 "item.yishu.ancient_scroll.note": "A ruined scroll from the ruins; read the next volume of the Chronicle.",
 "item.yishu.qi_pill.note": "Brewed from yarrow and astral dust; wounds close on their own.",
 "item.yishu.clarity_pill.note": "Thin as a cicada wing; night roads read clearly.",
 "item.yishu.calm_pill.note": "A settled mind keeps ill winds at bay.",
 "item.yishu.swift_pill.note": "Wind underfoot; you run as if pushed along.",
 "item.yishu.ward_pill.note": "Wards off fire-sha; you can stand near lava for a while.",
 "item.yishu.taisui_pill.note": "Tai Sui talisman in the furnace; one pill a year is enough.",
 "item.yishu.talisman_paper.note": "Cut yellow paper, ready to carry a charm.",
 "item.yishu.star_fur.note": "A layer of soft light shed by a star fox; faintly warm.",
 "item.yishu.jade_wool.note": "The finest wool of the Jade Realm; said to calm the heart.",
 "item.yishu.ink_membrane.note": "A translucent ink-dark film; hexagram lines show against light.",
 "item.yishu.vein_scale.note": "A plate from a vein turtle; every ring is a year.",
 "item.yishu.vein_map.note": "Unfolded, the ink crawls toward the nearest ruin.",
 "item.yishu.bagua_mirror.note": "Raise it and every living thing within sixteen blocks shows itself.",
 "item.yishu.astral_seeds.note": "Plant on farmland; grows a wheat that drinks starlight.",
 "item.yishu.astral_grain.note": "Grain from astral wheat; faintly sweet.",
 "item.yishu.jade_seeds.note": "Plant on farmland; the ears split into jade beads.",
 "item.yishu.jade_grain.note": "Beads like little jade; filling.",
 "item.yishu.yao_seeds.note": "Plant on farmland; the pod bears a natural broken line.",
 "item.yishu.yao_pod.note": "Split it open — the broken line moves in the light.",
 "item.yishu.ziwei_token.note": "Token of the Emperor Star. Tear it and an unseen armour settles on you.",
 "item.yishu.tianfu_token.note": "Token of the Treasury Star. Not sudden wealth — just a granary that never empties.",
 "item.yishu.qisha_token.note": "Token of the General Star. Your hand closes by itself; your feet stop hesitating.",
 "item.yishu.guiren_talisman.note": "Charm of the Noble One. When the road ends, someone happens to walk by.",
 "item.yishu.qinglong_talisman.note": "Charm of the Azure Dragon. Wind at your back, one step for two.",
 "item.yishu.baihu_talisman.note": "Charm of the White Tiger. Killing intent in hand — quick and merciless.",
 "item.yishu.shengmen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Life. Wounds close; hunger fades.",
 "item.yishu.kaimen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Opening. The world brightens and luck loosens.",
 "item.yishu.xiumen_talisman.note": "Charm of the Gate of Rest. Doing nothing is the best doing.",
 "item.yishu.ziwei_star_dust.note": "Fine powder sieved from astral ore; the bones of a Zi Wei chart.",
 "item.yishu.liuren_shell.note": "A divination plate; one piece serves one lesson.",
 "item.yishu.qimen_shard.note": "A corner broken off the nine palaces; the lines still move.",
 "item.yishu.face_mirror.note": "Reads a villager's face. Sneak-read a noble face to spread their name for a trade discount.",
 "item.yishu.bagua_array_disc.note": "Right-click the ground to set a Bagua array: resistance and healing inside, fiends suppressed, gone at dawn.",
 "item.yishu.beidou_array_disc.note": "Right-click the ground to set a Big Dipper array: night vision and speed inside.",
 "item.yishu.zhaocai_array_disc.note": "Right-click the ground to set a Wealth array: Luck II inside.",
